. <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"9d8d2f29-27b5-4648-b084-5ca9f0b9964b":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Canada_Mats9_c8db7a0b-bc79-4e84-8411-ac9e65298389.jpg","image_width":480,"subtitle":"For added traction","title":"Tatami Surface","text":"<p>Designed with martial artists in mind, it minimizes the chances of slips and missteps. <\/p><p>Every stance, pivot, and ground move becomes more precise with this unique textured finish. <\/p><p>The added traction boosts confidence during high-intensity bouts. Train or compete, knowing that every step is backed by a grip-focused design. <\/p><p><\/p><p>Maximize your martial arts experience with Drako's commitment to excellence.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text-and-image2":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Canada_Mats10.jpg","image_width":480,"subtitle":"For Intense Training Sessions","title":"High Quality VINYL SPORTS MAT","text":"<p>Designed for both rigorous training sessions and high-octane competitions, the fine-grade vinyl ensures a non-slip surface, enhancing safety during intense bouts. <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"f90386e0-cfa6-4590-b3e0-a51c2a2a9d6a":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CanadaMats11.jpg","image_width":480,"subtitle":"For Maximum Impact","title":"High Quality Foam","text":"<p>Beneath the vinyl lies resilient foam, offering optimal cushioning and impact absorption.  They ensure superior impact absorption, guarding against injuries and strains. <\/p><p>✅ MMA Gyms and Dojos<br\/>✅ Judo and Jiu-Jitsu Training Centers<br\/>✅ Wrestling and Grappling Facilities<br\/>✅ Self-Defense and Combat Training<br\/>✅ Functional Fitness and CrossFit Studios<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"1683ec06-192a-4bb3-958e-0858c6f7a9d4":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14491778515073__1683ec06-192a-4bb3-958e-0858c6f7a9d4-168617709657fd7e31-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2_b9563419-cce8-447f-bd29-d0bc7cba143e.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"Made with High Quality VINYL SPORTS MAT","text":"<p>Designed for both rigorous training sessions and high-octane competitions, the fine-grade vinyl ensures a non-slip surface, enhancing safety during intense bouts. <\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14491778515073__1683ec06-192a-4bb3-958e-0858c6f7a9d4-168617709657fd7e31-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/4_1faa4884-5373-46a0-b293-2efe2e49aa25.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"High Quality Foam for Maximum Impact","text":"<p>Beneath the vinyl lies resilient foam, offering optimal cushioning and impact absorption.  They ensure superior impact absorption, guarding against injuries and strains. <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"cfdde3d6-dcc3-4103-a0d1-769b4b28aacf":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Untitled_design_6.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"Smooth or tatami","text":"<p>Choose your surface. Opt for the best fit for your wrestling practice with our Roll-Out Combat Sports Mat. These mats offer a choice between a smooth surface for swift movements or a tatami texture for enchanced grip. Whichever you pick, expect excellent performance and traction in every grappling bout.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"593fceea-8a6b-406d-a9bf-3b1432fbfded":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image_width":650,"title":"Example title","text":"<p>Use this section to explain a set of product features, to link to a series of pages, or to answer common questions about your products. Add images for emphasis.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14491778515073__1683ec06-192a-4bb3-958e-0858c6f7a9d4-168617709657fd7e31-1","template--14491778515073__1683ec06-192a-4bb3-958e-0858c6f7a9d4-168617709657fd7e31-0","cfdde3d6-dcc3-4103-a0d1-769b4b28aacf","593fceea-8a6b-406d-a9bf-3b1432fbfded"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"5c2f3fca-5b2b-493a-9d12-11c017b07d6d":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14526489526401__5c2f3fca-5b2b-493a-9d12-11c017b07d6d-text-1":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>Each mat provides a stable yet forgiving surface, crucial for martial arts precision. <\/p><p>Whether it's rigorous training or intense competitions, our foam stands resilient.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14526489526401__5c2f3fca-5b2b-493a-9d12-11c017b07d6d-text-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"1148b4e3-2cf6-42af-910e-9aa29caa2a70":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/vinyl_tatami_tape-500x500_cd8a0a9a-5861-4fd7-95ed-250522fd0064.jpg","image_width":700,"subtitle":"","title":"Tatami Vinyl Seam-Free Tape for Combat Sports Mats","text":"<p>Tatami Vinyl Tape is great for martial arts mats or wrestling mats for a seamless look and is greatly used for permanent mat installations.<\/p>","button_label":"BUY Tatami Vinyl Seam-Free Tape for Combat Sports Mats","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text-and-image":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image86_1080x_83461889-7cf2-4dc4-aa0b-cc966426eb80.png","image_width":350,"subtitle":"","title":"SEAMING TAPE FOR COMBAT SPORTS MATS","text":"<p>Seam-Free Tape for Combat Sports Mats is ideal for joining wrestling and martial art mats sections together. Combine multiple roll out sports mats to achieve your desired surface area.<\/p>","button_label":"buy seam-free tape for combat sports mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/seam-free-tape-for-combat-sports-mats","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"3eb2f88f-12e5-4f87-aabb-ad99d885f103":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/store_tape_large-500x500_32048b33-8b41-4422-9aa9-173730172f7c.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Transparent Seam-Free Tape for Combat Sports Mats","text":"<p>Seam-Free Tape for Combat Sports Mats is ideal for joining wrestling and martial art mats sections.<\/p><p>This sports mat tape is reusable and clear.<\/p>","button_label":"BUY Transparent Seam-Free Tape for Combat Sports Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/transparent-seam-free-tape-for-combat-sports-mats","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"758f7b87-b80b-4940-9ae6-e317e6db90e5":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"template--14491778515073__758f7b87-b80b-4940-9ae6-e317e6db90e5-16861021769c2b147a-0":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Do you offer custom-sized mats?","text":"<p>Custom sizes by the foot are also available. If you'd like to order a custom size please call us at1-866-362-2053 or email us at <a href=\"mailto:%20sales@matsupplier.com\">sales@canadamats.c<\/a>a<\/p>"}},"template--14491778515073__758f7b87-b80b-4940-9ae6-e317e6db90e5-16861021769c2b147a-1":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"How are mat sections joined together?","text":"<p>Our martial arts mats are joined together using mat tape, with two different options available: clear reusable mat tape, or seam-free semi-permanent vinyl tape. We do not offer a tapeless mat options at this time.<\/p>"}},"dba51aba-7297-4b62-b757-d92d0c035f48":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Do the mats include storage straps?","text":"<p>Yes, each roll comes with one nylon & plastic buckle strap for easy storage. Additional straps are available for purchase.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14491778515073__758f7b87-b80b-4940-9ae6-e317e6db90e5-16861021769c2b147a-0","template--14491778515073__758f7b87-b80b-4940-9ae6-e317e6db90e5-16861021769c2b147a-1","dba51aba-7297-4b62-b757-d92d0c035f48"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"FAQs"}},"4c6eafb2-b051-4d8a-a5e4-38add5334a08":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14526489526401__4c6eafb2-b051-4d8a-a5e4-38add5334a08-text_block-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Canada_Mats9_a17b2d6d-21d1-4b8a-a5c3-5516e35cf491.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14526489526401__4c6eafb2-b051-4d8a-a5e4-38add5334a08-text_block-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Canada_Mats5_c53acc41-9a77-42ec-af79-5140b1192e99.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14526489526401__4c6eafb2-b051-4d8a-a5e4-38add5334a08-text_block-3":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Canada_Mats7_6e877c56-a8f3-4fb0-aa35-0bc510990a53.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--1452648952640